  "cause": {
    "corrective_workstream": "C5 successor recovery after protected C4 handoff revalidation",
    "kind": "terminal-campaign-with-revalidated-partial-publications",
    "summary": "The campaign publicly verified 36 independent handoffs in their original workflows. Findutils and Less published complete immutable handoffs and passed Kandelo anonymous all-asset readback before the tap verifier miscompared build and runtime dependencies. Protected Stage V commit b25ccf4d86af9ba9ffe7a33ece66f2e340c9b102 corrects that comparison; durable anonymous readback supplement 1e4a68c385ae1f15172e1f9f2f27480dbe2a632a07efd0411f70002049c40a19 independently revalidates both exact releases with those protected bytes. Ruby and Vim failed before handoff publication, and Git never dispatched, so those three builds continue under a successor without mutating this campaign."
  },
